# Evaluator-owned receipts are committed; harness state, workspaces, raw harness logs and per-trial tokens are not.
**/trials/*/*/*/state/
**/trials/*/*/*/workspace/
**/trials/*/*/*/logs/*
!**/trials/*/*/*/logs/adapter.log
**/trials/*/*/*/trial.json
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
**/trials/*/*/*/compose.serve.yaml
# The gbrain sidecar's per-trial token and logs, and every preflight's token and sidecar logs, stay out of the repository.
**/trials/*/*/*/gbrain/
*preflight-*/
**/ingest-tokens.json
**/tokens.json
# Per-trial hook receipts of the installer cells (issue #153): the install record, ready (turn_hook "ran") and the hook's own run.
# Small and token-free.
!**/trials/*/*/*/logs/gbrain-install.json
!**/trials/*/*/*/logs/ready
!**/trials/*/*/*/logs/gbrain-hook.claude-code.json
# Codex's hook-run record is left out: its trust_key line reads as a secret-named value to gstack-pregate's scanner. Its
# content (the hook ran at ready and printed the rule) is also in each trial's ready file and trials.jsonl.
# The installer's settings.json.bak (the pre-hook settings, listed in the view manifest) is left out under pregate's
# scratch-name rule.
**/settings.json.bak
# The shard, smoke, fan-out and attach logs this run's report cites (the repository's root rule ignores *.log).
!*.log
!**/*.log
